    <briefdescription>
<para><computeroutput>MonHashTable</computeroutput> trait for <computeroutput><ref refid="moninfo_8hpp_a75641a782b0ba6d753ef03651b07b5c2_1a75641a782b0ba6d753ef03651b07b5c2" kindref="member">packed_monomial</ref></computeroutput>s that include the component coordinate in equality. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="class_monomials_with_component_a421649283968ffc043e3bcbee7a34d20_1a421649283968ffc043e3bcbee7a34d20" kindref="member">hash_value</ref></computeroutput> mixes the leading two ints of the packed monomial (the precomputed hash plus the component) so two monomials with the same exponent vector but different components hash to different buckets. <computeroutput><ref refid="class_monomials_with_component_a89ce53eb88f748d59c3522f72b3ba607_1a89ce53eb88f748d59c3522f72b3ba607" kindref="member">is_equal</ref></computeroutput> defers to <computeroutput><ref refid="class_monomial_info_a0034bc992ad667ca5a41a3dcc9e71389_1a0034bc992ad667ca5a41a3dcc9e71389" kindref="member">MonomialInfo::is_equal</ref></computeroutput>, which compares both the monomial body and its component. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
